<description>&lt;p&gt;Journalist Tomás Beltrán was murdered outside his home and two local election candidates were shot dead in El Oro, while a priest died when a crucifix fell during mass, showing continued attacks on public figures in Ecuador. A Latin America Risk Report notes ongoing campaign violence in the country in November 2026. These incidents occur amid a broader security crisis driven by criminal organizations linked to drug trafficking since 2018. The UCDP recorded 2 battle-related deaths in 2019, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiW0FVX3lxTFBaR2NJSnEtNGdGS05uaU94T05ULXIyQW4yYXdzYnpZMWdGOTU5b1JnSEhfdWNNRjBlNkxwNVZhLXI3aWktSlVkeHlvQ2p3Skg3UUlLLW9HTkd3c2s?oc=5&quot;&gt;BBC&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMifEFVX3lxTE1oRXRQUF95bHFfeW1jM1E2dDhOMnMwWWRuRGxVMGp3dElscUxDTGR3aENpNEFOOHFWWGFiQm5PT1BDSko5Smk3SFE1NVN4a3hnMTZXdU9zQzZ4ZHEwak5XYXFIcXhXWFVsVExPWHJERDZNQlNZMHBqcmlIZUg?oc=5&quot;&gt;The Guardian&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;WPDE&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMie0FVX3lxTE1EcDlLdi1tcG56a1NVaWJXYkQ4dFg5Rms4LWlILVdxYW1FdFNJQ0Y0N21aWTNHRjlTdHB3U2J5dU9YSGxBZ0VqRGtkTmFVVkI5anhNWC1mM0FZV1QyYUtBdEJQbVppV3JOTS1xbnd6Y1JNZ05kUzkyaVMyaw?oc=5&quot;&gt;Latin Times&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMirgFBVV95cUxPZTRhRk5uLV9fZG5fQW9YQ21ZS0lUYUNSejhrRkM0OTJrRW1maElybWwyaFlxODBnSEJITmZiZzlNQnJuV1cwMHczV0sxNm9SQVdVUG1ZeUdNaVV2eDN4bS1rRnZFSC1GZnBJdkRnX1A3UER2OUtJek9LNnFNbTRxb2NxVEE1US1KZlhYZGo4M1JTVjFIcVNfcnlDTHZHZXd5MXlvNXlLSnFDY29mVlE?oc=5&quot;&gt;SSBCrack&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMihAFBVV95cUxPb0RhZTEtYlF0YWZJX0lmOTBENWU1QlBicTdUcFBZa2EyaGYwSE9HMjBRcTI2dFBmTTl0WnVVelF5ZGJWWTVSdjFHWmxESVdabVp3SW1rcmd1d1BkQXRhbU53Z